  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The energy of one mole of photons of radiation of frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Jmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is _____ .<br />(Nearest integer)<br />(Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>626</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mi>Js</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>022</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)",
    "image": null
